    "name": "Light Dude - A Dimpossible Game",
    "steam_appid": 3055110,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/dd7430053faff025c17294bc13a2ab0b.poster.avif?t=1755421293\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/dd7430053faff025c17294bc13a2ab0b.webm?t=1755421293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/dd7430053faff025c17294bc13a2ab0b.mp4?t=1755421293\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Light Dude</strong> the level goes dark when you move so that every obstacle in the level gets hidden! Once you stop moving, the level reveals again!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Careful!</strong> You\u2019ve only got a handful of lights each level. Move and stop too often, and you\u2019ll run out of lights and be in total darkness for the rest of the level!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/b0b8c280e822c651292b2cbfe69cf3c1.poster.avif?t=1755421293\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/b0b8c280e822c651292b2cbfe69cf3c1.webm?t=1755421293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/b0b8c280e822c651292b2cbfe69cf3c1.mp4?t=1755421293\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Variety</strong> \u2013 Chapters with different puzzles, obstacles and boss fights.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Humor</strong> \u2013 Lots of laughs as the game roasts you when you lose!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge Mode</strong> \u2013 Replay Light Dude with no restarts, speed runs, and more.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play it your style </strong>\u2013 Full Keyboard &amp; Controller support.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/8f4618f80f3df8d20718f1ee616dd6e5.poster.avif?t=1755421293\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/8f4618f80f3df8d20718f1ee616dd6e5.webm?t=1755421293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/8f4618f80f3df8d20718f1ee616dd6e5.mp4?t=1755421293\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/dd7430053faff025c17294bc13a2ab0b.poster.avif?t=1755421293\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/dd7430053faff025c17294bc13a2ab0b.webm?t=1755421293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/dd7430053faff025c17294bc13a2ab0b.mp4?t=1755421293\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Light Dude</strong> the level goes dark when you move so that every obstacle in the level gets hidden! Once you stop moving, the level reveals again!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Careful!</strong> You\u2019ve only got a handful of lights each level. Move and stop too often, and you\u2019ll run out of lights and be in total darkness for the rest of the level!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/b0b8c280e822c651292b2cbfe69cf3c1.poster.avif?t=1755421293\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/b0b8c280e822c651292b2cbfe69cf3c1.webm?t=1755421293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/b0b8c280e822c651292b2cbfe69cf3c1.mp4?t=1755421293\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Variety</strong> \u2013 Chapters with different puzzles, obstacles and boss fights.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Humor</strong> \u2013 Lots of laughs as the game roasts you when you lose!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge Mode</strong> \u2013 Replay Light Dude with no restarts, speed runs, and more.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play it your style </strong>\u2013 Full Keyboard &amp; Controller support.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/8f4618f80f3df8d20718f1ee616dd6e5.poster.avif?t=1755421293\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/8f4618f80f3df8d20718f1ee616dd6e5.webm?t=1755421293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/8f4618f80f3df8d20718f1ee616dd6e5.mp4?t=1755421293\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "A puzzle game where the lights go off when you move! Stop to observe the level, plan your next run path, then run blindly in the dark towards the exit point! It\u2019s the game version of walking through your house in the dark and praying not to stub your toe!",
